# MODULE.bazel.lock is committed and every invocation must match it. A change to
# MODULE.bazel, Cargo.toml or Cargo.lock that moves module resolution or a
# module extension's result fails here until the lock is regenerated with
#   bazel mod deps --lockfile_mode=update
# and committed. The Bazel build job runs a planted control that proves this
# flag turns a stale lock red.
common --lockfile_mode=error
